sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Depositor
    participant V as Vault — ERC-7540
    participant C as TrancheAccountant
    participant K as Keeper
    participant P as TranchePipeModule
    participant H as TrancheJITHook
    participant A as LendingPool — rest

    U->>V: requestRedeem(shares, controller, owner)
    V->>C: onTrancheRedeem(isSenior, hookShares)
    C->>C: lock shares in claimableSenior / claimableJunior
    K->>C: rebalance() — public, idempotent
    C->>V: moveShares(...) pegs entitlement, never below locked balance
    K->>C: fulfillRedeem(isSenior, user)
    C->>V: rate locked via admin-redeem path
    Note over K,C: junior fills revert while any senior request is pending — SeniorPriority
    Note over C: after expiry fulfillRedeem becomes permissionless
    U->>V: claimAndUnwrapUSDC(shares, receiver)
    V->>P: unwrapUSDC(shares, receiver, minUsdcOut)
    P->>H: moduleBurn(msg.sender, shares) + modulePull(usdc, receiver, amount)
    H->>A: withdraw from rest if idle USDC is short
    H-->>U: USDC

    Note over U,V: Junior-only alternatives — claimAndUnwrapEquity (oracle-priced, conversion fee stays in pool)<br/>and claimAndUnwrapProportional (oracle-free unit fractions). Senior vaults revert SeniorUsdcOnly.
    Note over U,V: Before expiry, fulfilled claims still redeem at the frozen rate after finalizeSettlement
